msgid "Vibrational perturbation theory (VPT2)"
msgstr "振动微扰理论 (VPT2)"

msgid ""
"The ``VPT2`` program is based on force constants, which are retrieved from "
"the polynomial coefficients as generated by the ``POLY`` program. Therefore,"
" each ``VPT2`` calculation requests a call of the ``POLY`` program prior to "
"the ``VPT2`` call. As the ``VPT2`` program relies on a quartic force field "
"(QFF), one may use the directive ``VTAYLOR,TYPE=QFF`` in the ``XSURF`` "
"program. This will lead to tremendous time savings as the size of the "
"potential energy surface is significantly reduced. However, this is an "
"option and the force constants can be retrieved from any potential provided "
"by the ``XSURF`` program. As the results may be sensitive to thresholds for "
"the resonance treatment, the user may be careful concerning these. For "
"further details see:"
msgstr ""
"``VPT2`` 程序基于力常数，这些力常数从 ``POLY`` 程序生成的多项式系数中获取。因此，每次 ``VPT2`` 计算都要求在调用 "
"``VPT2`` 之前先调用 ``POLY`` 程序。由于 ``VPT2`` 程序依赖于四次力场 (QFF)，用户可以在 ``XSURF`` "
"程序中使用指令 ``VTAYLOR,TYPE=QFF``\\ 。这将显著节省时间，因为势能面的规模被大幅减小。然而，这是一个选项，力常数可以从 "
"``XSURF`` 程序提供的任何势能中获取。由于结果可能对共振处理的阈值敏感，用户可能需要谨慎对待这些阈值。更多细节请参阅："

msgid ""
"The ``VPT2`` program is currently limited to asymmetric top and linear "
"molecules. By default the ``VPT2`` program will compute the fundamental "
"transitions, but overtones and combination bands can be specified in the "
"``VIBSTATE`` program (being described in the ``VSCF`` manual)."
msgstr ""
"``VPT2`` 程序目前仅限于不对称陀螺和线性分子。默认情况下，\\ ``VPT2`` 程序将计算基频跃迁，但泛频和组合带可以在 "
"``VIBSTATE`` 程序中指定（在 ``VSCF`` 手册中有描述）。"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "The following *options* are available:"
msgstr "以下\\ *选项*\\ 可用："

msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

msgid ""
"The following example shows an input for water, for which a semi-quartic "
"force field will be generated at the MP2/cc-pVDZ level."
msgstr "以下示例展示了水分子的输入，将在MP2/cc-pVDZ级别生成半四次力场。"

msgid "``VPT2,options``"
msgstr "``VPT2,options``"

msgid ""
"Ramakrishnan, G. Rauhut, *Semi-quartic force fields retrieved from multi-"
"mode expansions: Accuracy, scaling behavior and approximations*, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4918587>`__ **142**, 154118 (2015)."
msgstr ""
"Ramakrishnan, G. Rauhut, *Semi-quartic force fields retrieved from multi-"
"mode expansions: Accuracy, scaling behavior and approximations*, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4918587>`__ **142**, 154118 (2015)."

msgid ""
"**``DIPOLE``\\ =\\ *n*** ``DIPOLE=1`` provides dipole moment surfaces to the"
" VPT2 program and thus allows for the calculation of infrared intensities."
msgstr "**``DIPOLE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``DIPOLE=1`` 向 VPT2 程序提供偶极矩面，从而允许计算红外强度。"

msgid ""
"**``DRTFREQ``\\ =\\ *value*** (=300.0 Default) Frequency threshold for "
"Darling-Dennison resonances."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``DRTFC``\\ =\\ *value*** (=0.01 Default) Threshold for Darling-Dennison "
"resonances concerning quartic force constants."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``FRTFREQ``\\ =\\ *value*** (=500.0 Default) This is the threshold for "
"Fermi resonance detection with respect to frequencies, i.e.  "
":math:`2\\omega_i - \\omega_k` (type 1) and :math:`\\omega_i + \\omega_j - "
"\\omega_k` (type 2)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``FRTFC``\\ =\\ *value*** (=0.01 Default) Threshold for Fermi resonances "
"concerning cubic force constants (type 1 and type2)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``INFO``\\ =\\ *n*** ``INFO=1`` provides a list of the values of all "
"relevant program parameters."
msgstr "**``INFO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``INFO=1`` 提供所有相关程序参数值的列表。"

msgid "**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *n***"
msgstr "**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *\\ n***"

msgid ""
"``PRINT``\\ =0 (default) prints the anharmonic vibrational frequencies and "
"the most important vibrational constants."
msgstr "``PRINT``\\ =0（默认）打印非谐振动频率和最重要的振动常数。"

msgid ""
"``PRINT``\\ =1 prints in addition the force constants as retrieved from the "
"polynomial coefficients."
msgstr "``PRINT``\\ =1 此外还打印从多项式系数得到的力常数。"

msgid ""
"``PRINT``\\ =2 prints the force constants and an analysis of the detected "
"resonances."
msgstr "``PRINT``\\ =2 打印力常数以及对检测到的共振的分析。"
